WEBVTT

00:07:58.288 --> 00:08:00.246
I would describe this moment in my

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:03.204
career slash business as nonexistent

00:08:03.204 --> 00:08:05.746
and lacking energy and time.

00:08:06.288 --> 00:08:10.163
I would describe this moment in my career
as transitional and testing

00:08:10.163 --> 00:08:13.329
the limits of my tolerance to anxious
thoughts and feelings.

00:08:16.204 --> 00:08:21.038
Yeah, those anxious thoughts translated
into sixty percent of our beta testers

00:08:21.038 --> 00:08:24.954
saying that they think about making
a big change in their life

00:08:24.954 --> 00:08:29.204
and work at least once a day,
if not multiple times a day.